{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_01",
      "hash": "d7ba3467a6083236",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n干得好！你战胜坂木了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_02",
      "hash": "d7ba3367a6083083",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我追着那个叫阿波罗的家伙，\\n出来一看……\\c\\n金黄市的火箭队队员\\n一个个的都逃跑了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_03",
      "hash": "d7ba3267a6082ed0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "还好[VAR TRNAME(0000)]够强。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_07",
      "hash": "d7ba3667a608359c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我其实\\n还是有点害怕的。\\c\\n一直在担心，万一最强的是\\n那些坏家伙，那该怎么办……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_08",
      "hash": "d7ba3d67a6084181",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能和[VAR TRNAME(0000)]一起\\n成功营救西尔佛，我特别高兴。\\c\\n这样将来就不会再有谁碰上\\n卡拉卡拉那样的遭遇了吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_04",
      "hash": "d7ba3967a6083ab5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！既然这里恢复了和平，\\n接下来就继续我们的道馆之旅吧！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你\\n去过[VAR COLOR(0006)]金黄道馆[VAR COLOR(0000)]了吗？\\r\\n你现在有几个道馆徽章呢？\\r\\n……噢，是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_05",
      "hash": "d7ba3867a6083902",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "难不成我们已经可以\\n挑战宝可梦联盟了吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0960_rival_06",
      "hash": "d7ba3767a608374f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我们互相加油吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0960_max",
      "hash": "21d11016938bba32"
    }
  ]
}
